    # "Nijah took my hand and placed it over her belly, where once again I could feel the swelling life and power coursing inside of her."
    "妮雅握住我的手，放在她的肚子上，我又一次能感受到她体内涌动的生命力和力量。"
    

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_secondpreg.rpy:16
